# Playwright snapshot baselines (visual regression).
#
# This directory holds PNG baselines for the storybook.spec.ts (33 snapshots:
# 11 stories x 3 themes) and canonical-pages.spec.ts (15 snapshots: 5 routes
# x 3 themes) suites.
#
# Baselines are seeded on the FIRST CI run via:
#   cd livos/packages/ui-kit
#   pnpm install
#   pnpm playwright install chromium --with-deps
#   pnpm --filter ui-kit storybook:build
#   pnpm playwright:update
#   git add playwright/__snapshots__/
#   git commit -m "test(121-06): seed Playwright snapshot baselines"
#
# Reason for empty-seed pattern (Phase 121-06 plan deviation):
#   Phase 121-06 executor runs on Windows host without GPU-accelerated
#   Chromium + npx http-server in scope. Per plan spec, leaving .gitkeep +
#   operator-seed instruction is the explicit-permitted fallback. The CI
#   workflow at .github/workflows/visual-regression.yml will produce the
#   first baseline on the next PR touching ui-kit/design-tokens/ui paths.
